``` PHP2Shell (CVE-2026-109618, CVE-2026-109619)
    Query 02. Memory errors outside any script and crashing PHP workers.
    Normal in-script memory errors and timeouts are left out on purpose. Check them during triage.
    Data      PHP, PHP-FPM and web server error logs.
    Schedule  Every hour with earliest=-1h. For the first run, use earliest="10/20/2026:00:00:00".
    Severity  Medium
    Tuning    Change the index. ```
index=web ((("Allowed memory size of" OR "Out of memory (allocated") "in Unknown on line 0") OR "exited on signal 11" OR "exit signal Segmentation fault") earliest=-1h
| eval signal=if(like(_raw, "%in Unknown on line 0%"), "Memory error before any script ran", "Worker crash")
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count AS events latest(_raw) AS example BY _time host signal
| sort -_time
